{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e1e2e3e4-elective-pool-and-mapping-01",
    "name": "Elective Pool & Course Mapping",
    "description": "# Elective Pool & Course Mapping APIs\n\nCollection covering the complete Elective Pool setup:\n1. **Elective Pool (Image 1)**: CRUD operations, scope configurations (Programme / Institute / Batch), status toggling, and search.\n2. **Elective Pool Subject Mapping (Image 2)**: Available courses list from Course Master with filters (programme, components, search), dynamic selection status ('Already in Pool' vs 'Available'), bulk add courses, view mapped courses, and remove course.\n\n### Base URL\n{{baseurl}} (Default: http://localhost:8080)\n\n### Auth\nBearer token ({{token}})",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseurl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..L31KFUz6KRDvJX9KxnAD_vZkWAjVX5mwp1WAW_QujdY"
    },
    {
      "key": "electivePoolId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "courseId",
      "value": "34"
    },
    {
      "key": "subjectId",
      "value": "129"
    }
  ],
